OL,3,GNEWSADon't tear down our WW2 prefab
OL,4,Ahomes, say residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA resident whose prefabricated home of
OL,7,Fmore than two decades has been
OL,8,Fearmarked for demolition says "they
OL,9,Fwere not meant to last all these years
OL,10,Fbut I love it here".
OL,12,FJuliusz Poppe, 79, and his neighbours
OL,13,Flive in 80-year-old prefab bungalows in
OL,14,FBretton Avenue, Derby.
OL,16,FThe single-storey, two-bedroom
OL,17,Fproperties were cheap to build and
OL,18,Fhelped improve living conditions after
OL,19,Fthe end of World War Two, but were
OL,20,Fsupposed to only last a decade or two.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
