OL,3,GNEWSADon't tear down our WW2 prefab
OL,4,Ahomes, say residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow a row has broken out between Derby
OL,7,FCity Council which says it has moved
OL,8,Fforward with a masterplan to redevelop
OL,9,Fthe properties as they do not meet
OL,10,Fnational standards, and residents who
OL,11,Fdo not want their homes to be lost.
